    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.12",
    "summary": "Use it in your opponent's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), during the [Fight step](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step), right after an enemy unit finishes resolving its attacks, on a friendly unit [eligible to fight](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step). Until the phase ends it gains the **[Fights First](vsdata:core-rule/fights-first)** ability, and you must pick it as your next unit to fight. Like any Stratagem, it can be used only [once in a phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
